 "summary": "High-level hardware description language whose behaviour is expressed as atomic guarded rules (term rewriting) over modules with guarded method interfaces, with Haskell-style types and polymorphism. Two syntaxes: BSV (SystemVerilog-like) and BH/Bluespec Classic (Haskell-like); the bsc compiler was open-sourced in 2020.",
